ISO-10303-21;
/* Ps013: L-bracket with all X-coordinates negated (mirrored): footprint (0,0),(-1,0),(-1,2),(1,2),(1,1),(0,1) extruded to z=1; negated X-coords ARE wired into all CARTESIAN_POINTs of CLOSED_SHELL faces of MANIFOLD_SOLID_BREP; valid geometry but wrong chirality; kernel accepts silently */
